(text "PROTOTYPE ONLY. Q501 sinks PWR_OK_SINK_FAIL_RELEASE when PG/5V healthy; floats on fail or unpowered. HOST must pull up ONLY to 3V3_AON through resistor; never coin-cell -> 5V, RAW, USB or BAT. THERMAL, GPIO INPUT LEAKAGE, AND PG FALL RESPONSE OPEN. Need 4th carrier signal pad prior to fab." (at 37 206.375 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "d3067b80-a3b3-42b9-8c6b-000000010027"))

